    "frontend_formula_location": "mo_gas_optics_rrtmgp.F90 lines 1607-1667. It calculates delta pressure, fact=1/(1+H2O VMR), m_air=(m_dry+m_h2o*H2O VMR)*fact, then col_dry=10*delta_plev*avogad*fact/(1000*m_air*100*g0). The replay driver passes PLEV*100, converting input hPa to Pa.",
