    "source_ordered_carrier_rule": [
      "Initialize all 45 layers using get_col_dry(H2O,PLEV*100).",
      "Replace only native prefix 1:32 using native_dry_mass(:,1:n_native)*avogad/(m_dry*10000._wp).",
      "Thus layers 33:45 remain pressure/H2O-derived get_col_dry values."
